{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/115988-deed-names-assistance","id":115988,"title":"Deed Names Assistance","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-19T11:33:13-07:00","id":115988,"title":"Deed Names Assistance","content":"So, I'm about to have a lot of werewolves that are going to need Deed Names. Any guides or resources that can help me out, or good suggestions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>GM of the <i>Walking Shadow</i> Campaigns</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/8992-the-hacks-and-houserules-of-walking-shadows\" target=\"_blank\">New System and Setting Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1040-neotiamat","name":"NeoTiamat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"471"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T12:40:36-07:00","id":116045,"title":"","content":"I think that A Song of Ice and Fire makes some excellent idea for Deed Names, if I've got this correctly. Otherwise you can post a few examples of the Uratha who would need such names and we'll see if we can't help you out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T21:26:26-07:00","id":116331,"title":"","content":"Base it on the history of the characters, what they did during, or after their first change, one particularly epic thing they did in their life or how they act in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-20T08:14:26-07:00","id":116503,"title":"","content":"Deednames are fun when they have multiple meanings beyond the obvious.<br /> <br /> <br /> One of my favourite Uratha characters was Samuru, a Storm Lord Cahalith. He worked as a pathologist to the Kyoto police department, yet was from an very old Storm Lord family. His name was in Japanese, Tsume no Shi (written western style to help reading it). Now, the direct translation would be either Claws of Death or Four of Claws. However, there are deeper meanings as well. As both four and death use the word 'shi', the number four is deemed unlucky in Japan. So his name could mean Bad Luck Claws as well. There is also a cultural fact that butchers and others who worked for corpses were unclean and lower caste. And that Butcher class often had four fingers in one hand.<br /> <br /> That, combined with his high class heritage all combine to the full meaning of his name. This person who puts his claws in dead things brings bad luck to the family.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-20T12:41:21-07:00","id":116642,"title":"","content":"Another good source that I feel fits Forsaken for some reason is looking up gang members or nicknames people might get in prison. I always got this more...casual tone wtih Forsaken's habits on deed naming compared to Apocalypse.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}